{"id":"n29684-1-12","stage":5,"title":"견문 · 见闻","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29684-1-12-1","ko":"이번 방학에는 무엇을 할 생각이니?","zh":"这个假期你打算做什么呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"방학에는","meaning":"放假","explanation":"방학：放假；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"방학","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20207","senseId":"1","lemma":"방학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무엇을","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"1","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할","meaning":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","explanation":"하다：表示实现前面动作的想法。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생각이니?","meaning":"想，决定","explanation":"생각：想，决定；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"4","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"236457354c2107a3","term":"방학","zh":"放假","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3","entryId":"20207","definition":"学校里一个学期结束后在一定期间内停止课业；或那个期间。","pronunciation":["방ː학"]},{"id":"c95167f3fe21887b","term":"무엇","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3","entryId":"17199","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["무얻"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"想，决定","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"在心里决意要做某事；或指想做某事的那种决心。","pronunciation":["생각"]}],"audio":"/audio/3afb107e8864fc05aabc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29684-1-12-2","ko":"유럽으로 배낭여행을 가서 구경도 많이 하고 견문을 넓혀서 돌아오려고요.","zh":"我打算去欧洲背包旅行，多看看风景，开阔一下眼界，然后再回来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유럽으로","meaning":"欧洲","explanation":"유럽：欧洲；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"유럽으로","audio":"/audio/e76728616170de15443e.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"배낭여행을","meaning":"背包旅行","explanation":"배낭여행：背包旅行；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"배낭여행","audio":"/audio/b01ee5af43182d85cd1d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58768","senseId":"1","lemma":"배낭여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"구경도","meaning":"赏，观看，游览","explanation":"구경：赏，观看，游览；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"구경","audio":"/audio/f7bcc82cf5b9252f8050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64484","senseId":"3","lemma":"구경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하고","meaning":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","explanation":"하다：表示两个以上的并列或反复。；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"26","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"견문을","meaning":"见闻，见识","explanation":"견문：见闻，见识；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"견문","audio":"/audio/bf0941ff2298802c130a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29684","senseId":"1","lemma":"견문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넓혀서","meaning":"开阔，拓宽","explanation":"넓히다：开阔，拓宽；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"넓히다","audio":"/audio/1870e0478420ed121180.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62344","senseId":"4","lemma":"넓히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌아오려고요.","meaning":"回，回来，归来","explanation":"돌아오다：回，回来，归来；려고요：礼貌地说明打算，或根据语调询问对方意图。","readings":[{"term":"돌아오다","audio":"/audio/cfe0233d2be88a8338fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66268","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌아오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b01ee5af43182d85","term":"배낭여행","zh":"背包旅行","audio":"/audio/b01ee5af43182d85cd1d.mp3","entryId":"58768","definition":"只背着背包、以少量的钱进行的自由旅行。","pronunciation":["배ː낭녀행"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"f7bcc82cf5b9252f","term":"구경","zh":"赏，观看，游览","audio":"/audio/f7bcc82cf5b9252f8050.mp3","entryId":"64484","definition":"用眼睛看或亲自体验。","pronunciation":["구ː경"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"bf0941ff2298802c","term":"견문","zh":"见闻，见识","audio":"/audio/bf0941ff2298802c130a.mp3","entryId":"29684","definition":"看到和听到的经验或通过这些所学到的知识。","pronunciation":["견ː문"]},{"id":"1870e0478420ed12","term":"넓히다","zh":"开阔，拓宽","audio":"/audio/1870e0478420ed121180.mp3","entryId":"62344","definition":"使涉及到的内容或范围变广泛。","pronunciation":["널피다"]},{"id":"cfe0233d2be88a83","term":"돌아오다","zh":"回，回来，归来","audio":"/audio/cfe0233d2be88a8338fd.mp3","entryId":"66268","definition":"返回原地或恢复原状。","pronunciation":["도라오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/120526b397594f0ebdf9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.513,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=29684","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":169,"sequenceScore":3.3397,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我打算去欧洲背包旅行，多看看风景，开阔一下眼界，然后再回来。","这个假期你打算做什么呢？","买皮鞋要去哪里？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这个假期你打算做什么呢？","买皮鞋要去哪里？","我打算去欧洲背包旅行，多看看风景，开阔一下眼界，然后再回来。"],"answer":2}]}
